# Add a comparison without breaking the calculator — learner brief

Fictional Northstar Services training material.

## Change
Same original calculator contract, shared price/setup. A10 seats/B12, price25.50, setup100. B-minus-A difference. Clear stale comparison if B invalid. Standalone starter supplied.

## Task

The controller wants to compare two seat-count scenarios using the same price and setup.

## Actions


1. State the requested change while keeping price/setup shared and the original formula fixed.
2. Ask AI to modify your source or the supplied standalone starter with a labeled second scenario.
3. Rerun every original valid and invalid case before testing the comparison.
4. Verify the supplied A/B outputs and difference sign.
5. Clear B after a successful result and confirm the comparison is removed or explicitly invalid, not stale.
6. Document what changed and which original behaviors still pass.


## Output
Change request; revised source; original-case regression results; comparison results; invalid-B behavior.

## Supplied local practice files

- calculator-starter.html

Keep these files together. Scripts take explicit paths; choose new output folders. Use a plain text editor to inspect source before running. Browser prototypes open locally; do not deploy them.
